<!-- 游戏自带解码器（Oodle / LZ5）的跨平台工具模式：Ryujinx ARMeilleure 执行游戏 main 里的解码函数（见 Program.cs 头注）。 -->
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
    <AssemblyName>gamedec</AssemblyName>
    <RyuSrc Condition="'$(RyuSrc)' == ''">$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)../../compat/tree</RyuSrc>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="$(RyuSrc)/src/ARMeilleure/ARMeilleure.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="$(RyuSrc)/src/Ryujinx.Cpu/Ryujinx.Cpu.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="$(RyuSrc)/src/Ryujinx.Memory/Ryujinx.Memory.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="$(RyuSrc)/src/Ryujinx.Common/Ryujinx.Common.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
